      "id": "claim_118d37d2184646c0b40eea00ea1d3b4f",
      "statement": "An LTX v3 segment is a big-endian file: LTX1 magic, a 100-byte header with page size, commit pages, MinTXID/MaxTXID, timestamp, pre-apply checksum and WAL salt fields, per-page LZ4-compressed records, a page index, and a 16-byte trailer.",
