    {
      "id": "claim_5f58bdfcf6ed4d028dfbbd48315bf444",
      "statement": "Capture runs synchronously against a WAL-mode connection with wal_autocheckpoint(0) and a held raw BEGIN read transaction that takes over checkpointing from SQLite, producing LTX segments via sync -> verify -> write_ltx_from_wal; the blocking shape exists because rusqlite::Connection is !Sync and checkpoint-vs-read-lock is the highest-risk interaction.",
